anchor.description:
The reference event (offset 0):
- a date (`"2008-09-15"`) or Unix seconds: the same instant for all rows;
- `"first"` | `"last"`: the earliest or latest time in the row's group;
- `{ "argmax": field }` | `{ "argmin": field }`: the time of the group's largest or smallest value of `field`   (the earliest one if several rows tie);
- `{ "field": name }`: a per-row reference time in a column (Unix seconds or an ISO date).

threshold.description:
Specify the threshold as one of:

- A number representing a fixed threshold in the unit of pixels;

- `"|xe-x|"`, using the distance between `xe` and `x` as threshold
